    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d772">

                <pb facs="1041" n="925" sameAs="frus:frus1923v01/pg925"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">822.51A/4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-06-26T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 26, 1923—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 27—2:29
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>85. My number 78, June 13, 9 a.m.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d772-f1"/> In reply to a
                    question by me Mr. Hord has just informed me that he intends leaving Haiti on
                    July 12th. He then asked if he should go with me to inform President <pb
                        facs="1042" n="926" xml:id="pg926"/> Borno. I informed him that I would
                    first communicate his intention to the Department and await instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
